WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.620
Care homes require lots of regular checks of their rooms, the fire

2
00:00:04.620 --> 00:00:06.460
doors, the kitchens and the equipment.

3
00:00:06.460 --> 00:00:09.940
With Quickler, your staff can do them in WhatsApp with a voice note

4
00:00:09.940 --> 00:00:12.210
or photos as they go around.

5
00:00:12.210 --> 00:00:16.260
Quickler writes the Record and puts every fault on the To do list.

6
00:00:16.260 --> 00:00:19.860
You can schedule the checks for the days that you need, and if one

7
00:00:19.860 --> 00:00:21.720
is missed, you'll be notified.

8
00:00:21.720 --> 00:00:25.440
So when an inspector asks, you have every Record available, with

9
00:00:25.440 --> 00:00:27.520
photos, dates and who did it.
